転身、頭角を現す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妻を娶ったので、店を持とうと貯金を始めたが数年後、妻が貯金を持って別の男と駆け落ち。生きる気力を失う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周りの人々の取り計らいで合同お見合いに出席し、そこで平グモちゃんに一目惚れする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平グモちゃんと結婚したのはいいが、引き籠もりのままではどうにもならないので、弟の長頼が重臣を務めている三好家に仕官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"トラウマに追われ、三好家当主に贔屓され、他の家臣の妬みに堪え、久秀は武家として立身してゆく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"果たして久秀はいつ爆死するのか !?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「俺だって戦なんかしたくないよ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"159167"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/351ad0c1f4ab2f97d731135bb07714aa5bdc475c358cd09ba47cd3ba587dbef8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/254be9b43544143b116f87fab22a64317d120607945b1cf2ed3c426774c518d1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡田一廣","creatorId":"vndb:s1824","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1824","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1824","name":"岡田 一廣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41059:159167:64846:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50956","characterName":"平グモちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"144593","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41059"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8527"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50956"},"originalCharacterName":"平グモちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去2回、父の顔を立てて商家へ嫁いだが、姑との折り合いが悪く、三行半を叩きつけて実家に戻って来ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父の言いつけで合同お見合いに出席し、そこで久秀に惚れられてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"久秀に求婚され、特に好きだということはなかったが、いつでもどちらからでも離縁を言い出せるならという条件で結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に別れる理由がないのでダラダラと久秀との結婚生活を続ける平グモちゃんであるが、果たして久秀の想いを受け入れる日は来るのであろうか !?"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8527","sourceWorkId":"17040","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去2回、父の顔を立てて商家へ嫁いだが、姑との折り合いが悪く、三行半を叩きつけて実家に戻って来ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父の言いつけで合同お見合いに出席し、そこで久秀に惚れられてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"久秀に求婚され、特に好きだということはなかったが、いつでもどちらからでも離縁を言い出せるならという条件で結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に別れる理由がないのでダラダラと久秀との結婚生活を続ける平グモちゃんであるが、果たして久秀の想いを受け入れる日は来るのであろうか !?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あいつ殺しちゃってもいいよ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"144593"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c27ff991e46f75a88a5d8fe235e47e5fe11268775b33fbf8e35d80c3495583a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/bac487a7ed63c8ec242706968259c6e5e13e3e846155cd9ee1cc73de4f41668a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梶田夕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41059:144593:6106:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50957","characterName":"楽ちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"144594","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41059"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8528"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50957"},"originalCharacterName":"楽ちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さい頃から久秀を慕っており、やっと合同お見合いという形で久秀とのお見合いにこぎ着けたが、悲願成就直前に、久秀は姉の平グモちゃんと結婚してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後、本来は平グモちゃんのお見合い相手であった田中与四郎と結婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幸せそうな日々を送る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"果たして楽ちゃんは、平グモちゃんに横取りされる前に、久秀をモノにできるのであろうか !?"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8528","sourceWorkId":"17040","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さい頃から久秀を慕っており、やっと合同お見合いという形で久秀とのお見合いにこぎ着けたが、悲願成就直前に、久秀は姉の平グモちゃんと結婚してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後、本来は平グモちゃんのお見合い相手であった田中与四郎と結婚。 幸せそうな日々を送る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"果たして楽ちゃんは、平グモちゃんに横取りされる前に、久秀をモノにできるのであろうか !?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「久秀さん、お元気ですか？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"144594"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/32ca4f1161fce8abd59fc9a68bba1595cc748b9040722ff952625caf3f48b6f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97e661f7e4a4b03eef1649ff9d6fcd1092293265a940d4d2737b95f47a2bf12a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"澤宮菜穂","creatorId":"vndb:s838","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s838","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s838","name":"澤宮 菜穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41059:144594:6019:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50958","characterName":"來栖","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"144595","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41059"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8529"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50958"},"originalCharacterName":"來栖","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"布教のために三好領へ訪れた耶蘇教宣教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大和領主の久秀に、硝石を安く売ると実利を説いて布教許可を得ようとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"果たして來栖は、日本を “ぱらいそ” に変えられるのであろうか !?"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8529","sourceWorkId":"17040","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"布教のために三好領へ訪れた耶蘇教宣教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大和領主の久秀に、硝石を安く売ると実利を説いて布教許可を得ようとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"果たして來栖は、日本を “ぱらいそ” に変えられるのであろうか !?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「コレ　デウス様　御加護！　ハレルヤ！　ハレルヤ!!」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"144595"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af7644e0d8265848420e31f89bda3842ea97b32f00f98d5a24f81e71cd09f1e1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7be54e960be1a9898c05fc3796f7e433c90afc8e7b208e9767d5c1538e860cc7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"川瀬ゆう子","creatorId":"vndb:s647","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s647","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s647","name":"川瀬 ゆう子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41059:144595:16174:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50959","characterName":"お曜様","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"144596","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41059"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8530"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50959"},"originalCharacterName":"お曜様","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"父・三好長慶が目をかけている久秀の有能さに気付き、「この者であれば官位も得られるか？」 と接近を始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしそれは長慶の奸計であったりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お曜は久秀の関心を得て、天下人の正妻に収まれるのであろうか !?"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8530","sourceWorkId":"17040","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"父・三好長慶が目をかけている久秀の有能さに気付き、「この者であれば官位も得られるか？」 と接近を始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしそれは長慶の奸計であったりもする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お曜は久秀の関心を得て、天下人の正妻に収まれるのであろうか !?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「名ばかりの将軍などは興味なし。取って代わるは我が婿殿よ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"144596"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b505e9b418a5c7d44b56c4f3db7e98a60d803c3e9867c08b00f6dd25049944d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e479db2691ba11e5f7aa60067e23218fff38f2622999aa405c2dc4c59d5337a2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林眞紀","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:41059:144596:5906:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50960","characterName":"聚楽","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"144597","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"41059"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8531"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50960"},"originalCharacterName":"聚楽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"河原者から信長の側女にまで成り上がった聚楽の悩みは、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"信長が自分に興味を示さないこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"信長の才能は認めているが、他に有能な男がいれば、いつでも乗り替えたい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな時に耳にしたのが久秀の噂であった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"信長に臣従してきた久秀に、いきなり謀反を持ちかける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"果たして聚楽は、この世の富を我が物と出来るのであろうか !?"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8531","sourceWorkId":"17040","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"河原者から信長の側女にまで成り上がった聚楽の悩みは、信長が自分に興味を示さないこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"信長の才能は認めているが、他に有能な男がいれば、いつでも乗り替えたい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな時に耳にしたのが久秀の噂であった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"信長に臣従してきた久秀に、いきなり謀反を持ちかける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"果たして聚楽は、この世の富を我が物と出来るのであろうか !?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「名ばかりの将軍などは興味なし。取って代わるは我が婿殿よ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"144597"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/